<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main id="content">
  <div class="wrap page-gap prose-page">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="kicker">The office</p>
      <h1>About this board</h1>
      <p class="lede">InternHub is the internship desk for enrolled students. It keeps one board, and one registrar.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="split">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Students in any faculty may read the board. An account needs a name, a student number, and a university email. From that account you apply, attach a résumé, and watch the registrar’s decision.</p>
        <p>There is one administrator: the career registrar. No second office account can be created from the site. Host organizations do not receive a login. They send the terms of a place to the office, and the registrar writes the posting.</p>
        <p>Each application belongs to one student and one internship. You may apply only once. The file then moves through four marks: submitted, under review, offered, or declined.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="facts">
        <p class="kicker">Who may use it</p>
        <h2>The register</h2>
        <div><dt>Students</dt><dd>Apply and track</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Registrar</dt><dd>One account</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Hosts</dt><dd>No login</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Records</dt><dd>Kept in SQLite</dd></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
